@startuml
title Home Page
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "HomePage.tsx" as HomePage
component "home-page.css" as Styles
component "tests/home-page.test.mjs" as Tests
component "SiteHeader" as SiteHeader
component "SiteFooter" as SiteFooter
component "Web Awesome Buttons" as WebAwesomeButtons
cloud "LinkedIn Profile" as LinkedIn
cloud "SimpleETL" as SimpleETL
cloud "CatapultCMS" as CatapultCMS
cloud "Idea Fab Labs" as IdeaFabLabs
cloud "LinkedIn Article" as Writing
cloud "Email Contact" as Email

HomePage --> Styles : page class contract
HomePage --> SiteHeader : branded navigation
HomePage --> SiteFooter : persistent footer
HomePage --> WebAwesomeButtons : primary link primitives
HomePage --> LinkedIn : profile link
HomePage --> SimpleETL : project link
HomePage --> CatapultCMS : work link
HomePage --> IdeaFabLabs : work link
HomePage --> Writing : article link
HomePage --> Email : contact CTA
Tests --> HomePage : verifies content and safety contract

note right of HomePage
The page owns launch copy and section layout.
Private source links, phone numbers, and
deployment details do not belong here.
end note

@enduml
